<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31267" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰσάλλομαι</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		
		3sg.
		aor. 2
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐσᾶλτο</span>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>spring</i> or <i>rush into,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐσήλατο τεῖχος Ἀχαιῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					12.438
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πύλας καὶ τεῖχος ἐσᾶλτο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					13.679
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				12.466
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πύργον -όμενοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>O.</u>
					8.38
				</span></i>
			 ; later <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς. ἐς τὸ πῦρ</span>
			<i>leap into</i> it, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.66
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰ. εἰς τὰ τείχη</span>
			v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				7.4.4
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνακειμένῳ εἰς τὸν αὐχέν᾽
					εἰσαλοίμην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					756
				</span></i>
			 ; [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς ἀσκόν</span>] upon a
			bladder, <i><span class="en">
				Eub.
				8
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ κρατί μοι πότμος εἰσήλατο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					1345
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.).</div>
